I would highly recommend you take this course

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:58.740
on classical mechanics, which will form the
bedrock of understanding for you to start

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:03.950
applying physics, like figuring how much batteries
to include for a drone design.

